  "releaseNotes": "v1.10.17: Fixed Connected event not firing after fresh gateway reconnections (session expiry). Consumers tracking IsConnected via DiscordEvents would permanently show \"Disconnected\" because Connected only fired once on the initial READY and never on subsequent reconnections. Added _isReady reset in ResumeAsync fallback-to-identify and op=9 INVALID_SESSION paths to guarantee Connected fires after every full reconnect.",
